{
  "route": "hyperlinks",
  "routeLabel": "Hyperlink entries",
  "scriptId": "0049",
  "lineCount": 135,
  "lines": [
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0049:000011",
      "line": 11,
      "sourceId": "0049:000011",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　草原を通るたびに紅緒あずさがいることは、とう\nに気づいた。",
      "english": "Shinobu had long since noticed that Azusa Benio was there whenever he passed through the meadow.",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0049:000012",
      "line": 12,
      "sourceId": "0049:000012",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　おそらくここは、彼女の遊び場なのだろう。\n　毎日来ている形跡もある。",
      "english": "This was probably her playground. There were signs that she came every day.",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0049:000018",
      "line": 18,
      "sourceId": "0049:000018",
      "speakerJa": "あずさ",
      "speakerEn": "Azusa",
      "japanese": "「…………」",
      "english": "“............”",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0049:000019",
      "line": 19,
      "sourceId": "0049:000019",
      "speakerJa": "忍",
      "speakerEn": "Shinobu",
      "japanese": "「…………」",
      "english": "“............”",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0049:000021",
      "line": 21,
      "sourceId": "0049:000021",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　忍が施設に行くたびに、あずさはいた。",
      "english": "Every time Shinobu went to the facility, Azusa was there.",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0049:000022",
      "line": 22,
      "sourceId": "0049:000022",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　そしてまったく会話することはなかった。\n　通学時と同様、無言のまま接近し、離れていく二人。",
      "english": "And they never exchanged a word. Just as on the way to school, they approached and parted in silence.",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0049:000023",
      "line": 23,
      "sourceId": "0049:000023",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　朝と違うのは、他人もいる環境での行事は個人が\n希薄になるが、二人っきりではそうもいかないとい\nう点だ。",
      "english": "The difference from the morning was that, where the presence of others diluted the individual, no such thing happened when they were alone.",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0049:000024",
      "line": 24,
      "sourceId": "0049:000024",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　草原がいつからあずさの大切な場所だったのかは\n不明だ。",
      "english": "How long the meadow had been precious to Azusa, he did not know.",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0049:000025",
      "line": 25,
      "sourceId": "0049:000025",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　が、闖入者である忍に対して、あずさは冷徹な視\n線を投げかけてくるのが常だった。",
      "english": "But she invariably turned a cold gaze on Shinobu, the intruder.",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0049:000026",
      "line": 26,
      "sourceId": "0049:000026",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　目線を合わせれば因縁をつけられる気配もある。\n　極力、相手を刺激しないように移動する。",
      "english": "Meeting her eyes seemed likely to make her pick a fight. He moved with the greatest possible care not to agitate her.",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0049:000027",
      "line": 27,
      "sourceId": "0049:000027",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　下手に目の前で迂回するなども良くない。\n　自然に、目に入っていないという素振りで、通り\n過ぎる。",
      "english": "Making an obvious detour in front of her would be unwise too. He passed naturally, pretending she had never entered his field of view.",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0049:000028",
      "line": 28,
      "sourceId": "0049:000028",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　施設に行くたびに繰り返した。",
      "english": "He went through the same routine every time he visited the facility.",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0049:000038",
      "line": 38,
      "sourceId": "0049:000038",
      "speakerJa": "あずさ",
      "speakerEn": "Azusa",
      "japanese": "「…………」",
      "english": "“............”",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0049:000039",
      "line": 39,
      "sourceId": "0049:000039",
      "speakerJa": "忍",
      "speakerEn": "Shinobu",
      "japanese": "「…………」",
      "english": "“............”",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
