    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0049:000061",
      "line": 61,
      "sourceId": "0049:000061",
      "speakerJa": "忍",
      "speakerEn": "Shinobu",
      "japanese": "「…………」",
      "english": "“............”",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0049:000071",
      "line": 71,
      "sourceId": "0049:000071",
      "speakerJa": "あずさ",
      "speakerEn": "Azusa",
      "japanese": "「…………」",
      "english": "“............”",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0049:000072",
      "line": 72,
      "sourceId": "0049:000072",
      "speakerJa": "忍",
      "speakerEn": "Shinobu",
      "japanese": "「…………」",
      "english": "“............”",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0049:000073",
      "line": 73,
      "sourceId": "0049:000073",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　いつごろからか、あずさの面差しが柔らかく変化\nしていったことは気づいていた。",
      "english": "At some point, he had noticed Azusa's features beginning to soften.",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0049:000083",
      "line": 83,
      "sourceId": "0049:000083",
      "speakerJa": "あずさ",
      "speakerEn": "Azusa",
      "japanese": "「…………」",
      "english": "“............”",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0049:000084",
      "line": 84,
      "sourceId": "0049:000084",
      "speakerJa": "忍",
      "speakerEn": "Shinobu",
      "japanese": "「…………」",
      "english": "“............”",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0049:000085",
      "line": 85,
      "sourceId": "0049:000085",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　だとしても忍は関わるつもりはなかった。\n　交友のメリットは０だからだ。",
      "english": "Even so, Shinobu had no intention of involving himself with her. The benefit of friendship was zero.",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0049:000095",
      "line": 95,
      "sourceId": "0049:000095",
      "speakerJa": "あずさ",
      "speakerEn": "Azusa",
      "japanese": "「…………」",
      "english": "“............”",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0049:000096",
      "line": 96,
      "sourceId": "0049:000096",
      "speakerJa": "忍",
      "speakerEn": "Shinobu",
      "japanese": "「…………」",
      "english": "“............”",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0049:000098",
      "line": 98,
      "sourceId": "0049:000098",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　監視対象との接触は、はかばかしくない結果を生\nんでいた。",
      "english": "His attempts to make contact with the surveillance targets had produced little progress.",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0049:000099",
      "line": 99,
      "sourceId": "0049:000099",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　失敗続きだとも言えた。\n　自分には難度が高すぎる仕事だ、とも思った。",
      "english": "They could just as easily be called a string of failures. At times, he thought the work was simply too difficult for him.",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0049:000100",
      "line": 100,
      "sourceId": "0049:000100",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　だが同じ世代の子供であり、自分がやるしかない\nこともわかっていた。",
      "english": "But he was a child of the same generation, and he knew the work had to fall to him.",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0049:000101",
      "line": 101,
      "sourceId": "0049:000101",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　千鳥がじきじきに現場におりてきていることもある。",
      "english": "Chidori herself had even come down into the field.",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0049:000102",
      "line": 102,
      "sourceId": "0049:000102",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　成果なく時間だけが流れていく。\n　千鳥はそれをどこまで許すだろうか？",
      "english": "Time continued to pass without results. How long would Chidori permit that?",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0049:000103",
      "line": 103,
      "sourceId": "0049:000103",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　紅緒あずさなどという個体に関わっているゆとり\nはない。",
      "english": "He had no time to spare on an individual such as Azusa Benio.",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0049:000113",
      "line": 113,
      "sourceId": "0049:000113",
      "speakerJa": "あずさ",
      "speakerEn": "Azusa",
      "japanese": "「……くちんッ」",
      "english": "“...Achoo!”",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0049:000114",
      "line": 114,
      "sourceId": "0049:000114",
      "speakerJa": "忍",
      "speakerEn": "Shinobu",
      "japanese": "「……？」",
      "english": "“...?”",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0049:000115",
      "line": 115,
      "sourceId": "0049:000115",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　一度だけ足を止めて、あずさを見たことがあった。",
      "english": "Once, he stopped and looked at Azusa.",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0049:000117",
      "line": 117,
      "sourceId": "0049:000117",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　少女は鼻をこすって恥ずかしげに顔を伏せた。\n　意味はない。",
      "english": "The girl rubbed her nose and ducked her head in embarrassment. It meant nothing.",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0049:000121",
      "line": 121,
      "sourceId": "0049:000121",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　いつも見る側のあずさだ。\n　真正面から見られたことが初めてであったと、た\nだそれだけのことだった。",
      "english": "Azusa was always the one who watched. It was simply the first time he had looked her full in the face—nothing more.",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0049:000123",
      "line": 123,
      "sourceId": "0049:000123",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　そして―――",
      "english": "And then—",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0049:000129",
      "line": 129,
      "sourceId": "0049:000129",
      "speakerJa": "忍",
      "speakerEn": "Shinobu",
      "japanese": "「…………」",
      "english": "“............”",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0049:000130",
      "line": 130,
      "sourceId": "0049:000130",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　その日、紅緒あずさはいなかった。",
      "english": "That day, Azusa Benio was not there.",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0049:000131",
      "line": 131,
      "sourceId": "0049:000131",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　少女はすでに平常化していた。\n　いないことが、奇妙なまでに。",
      "english": "Her presence had already become routine. So much so that her absence seemed strangely out of place.",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0049:000132",
      "line": 132,
      "sourceId": "0049:000132",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　忍は判断に迷う。",
      "english": "Shinobu was unsure what to do.",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0049:000133",
      "line": 133,
      "sourceId": "0049:000133",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　民間人だ。\n　放っておけば良いとも思う。普通であればそうだ\nろう。",
      "english": "She was a civilian. He thought he could leave her alone. Normally, that would be the thing to do.",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0049:000134",
      "line": 134,
      "sourceId": "0049:000134",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　だがこの場にあずさがいないのは、明らかにおか\nしいと……直感が告げていた。",
      "english": "But his intuition told him with unmistakable clarity that Azusa's absence from this place was wrong.",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0049:000135",
      "line": 135,
      "sourceId": "0049:000135",
      "speakerJa": "忍",
      "speakerEn": "Shinobu",
      "japanese": "（まさか……これは？）",
      "english": "(No... could this be—?)",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0049:000149",
      "line": 149,
      "sourceId": "0049:000149",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　幻視―――",
      "english": "A vision—",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0049:000150",
      "line": 150,
      "sourceId": "0049:000150",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　何かよからぬことが起こっている。\n　施設のそばで。",
      "english": "Something bad was happening. Near the facility.",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0049:000151",
      "line": 151,
      "sourceId": "0049:000151",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　忍が行動するに、充分なレベルに事態は推移した\nのである。",
      "english": "The situation had reached a level that warranted Shinobu's intervention.",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0049:000156",
      "line": 156,
      "sourceId": "0049:000156",
      "speakerJa": "忍",
      "speakerEn": "Shinobu",
      "japanese": "「…………」",
      "english": "“............”",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0049:000157",
      "line": 157,
      "sourceId": "0049:000157",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　時刻は、三時五分。",
      "english": "The time was 3:05.",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0049:000158",
      "line": 158,
      "sourceId": "0049:000158",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　三時の検診に間に合うようやってきたのだ。\n　もう遅刻は確定。",
      "english": "He had come this way to make his three o'clock checkup. Now he was certain to be late.",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0049:000159",
      "line": 159,
      "sourceId": "0049:000159",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　今まで遅れたことはない。\n　一度は許容されるにしても、続けば措置がとられ\nることだろう。",
      "english": "He had never been late before. A first offense might be tolerated, but repeated lateness would surely bring corrective measures.",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0049:000160",
      "line": 160,
      "sourceId": "0049:000160",
      "speakerJa": "忍",
      "speakerEn": "Shinobu",
      "japanese": "（いや……これは看過できない出来事だ）",
      "english": "(No... this is an incident that cannot be overlooked.)",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0049:000161",
      "line": 161,
      "sourceId": "0049:000161",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　忍は少女に近づく。\n　周囲を見渡す。",
      "english": "Shinobu approached the girl. He surveyed the surroundings.",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0049:000162",
      "line": 162,
      "sourceId": "0049:000162",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　開発放棄された土地でも、ここは特に危険な場所だ。",
      "english": "Even within this abandoned tract, this was an especially dangerous place.",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0049:000163",
      "line": 163,
      "sourceId": "0049:000163",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　草原のはしに崖がある。\n　下は柔らかい土で、高低差も数メートルほどしか\nない。",
      "english": "A cliff marked one edge of the meadow. The earth below was soft, and the drop only a few meters.",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0049:000164",
      "line": 164,
      "sourceId": "0049:000164",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
